# 🏢 WorkSphere — Multi-Tenant Leave & Workforce Management SaaS

> A multi-tenant SaaS where companies register and independently manage employees, departments, leave, attendance, approvals and reports — with strict tenant isolation.
> Built as a **modular monolith** on **React · Node.js/Express · PostgreSQL · Redis · Kafka**, deployed with **Docker on AWS (EC2 + RDS)**.

![Node](https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-22%2B-green) ![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-5-black) ![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-16-blue) ![Redis](https://img.shields.io/badge/Redis-7-red) ![Kafka](https://img.shields.io/badge/Kafka-KRaft-black) ![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-19-61dafb) ![Jest](https://img.shields.io/badge/tests-Jest%20%2B%20Supertest-c21325)

