## 🎯 What This Project Demonstrates

This is **not** a CRUD demo. The focus is backend correctness under real-world conditions:

- **Tenant isolation** enforced in the application *and* the database (composite foreign keys + Postgres Row-Level Security)
- **Atomic operations** — approving leave and deducting balance in one transaction with row-level locks
- **Race-condition prevention** — overlapping leave blocked by a Postgres **exclusion constraint**; concurrent approvals handled with `SELECT … FOR UPDATE`
- **Reliable event publishing** — the **transactional outbox** pattern (no lost events)
- **Kafka fundamentals** — partitions, keys & ordering, consumer groups, offsets, at-least-once delivery, idempotent consumers, retries, dead-letter topics
- **Secure auth** — short-lived access tokens, rotating refresh tokens with **reuse detection**, hashed tokens, rate-limited login, secure password reset
- **Production hygiene** — validation, centralised errors, structured logs, health checks, graceful shutdown, timeouts

---

## ✨ Features

| Area | Capabilities |
|---|---|
| **Authentication** | Company registration, login/logout, access + refresh tokens, refresh rotation with reuse detection, bcrypt hashing, RBAC, secure password reset, active-session list & revoke |
| **Multi-tenancy** | Many companies on one platform; isolated data, departments and leave policies per company |
| **Employees** | Create, update, deactivate; assign department, role and reporting manager; profiles; search, filter, paginate |
| **Departments** | CRUD per company; department-wise statistics |
| **Leave** | Annual / sick / unpaid; balances; apply, approve, reject, cancel; history; overlap prevention; concurrency-safe approvals |
| **Attendance** | Check-in / check-out; working hours; late-arrival tracking; daily & monthly reports |
| **Notifications** | In-app inbox + email; managers notified of requests; employees notified of decisions |
| **Dashboard** | Total employees, department stats, pending approvals, monthly leave stats, attendance summaries |
| **Audit logs** | Who did what, what changed (before/after), when — for employee, leave, role and admin actions |

### Roles

| Role | Can do |
|---|---|
| `admin` | Everything in their company: settings, leave policies, roles, all employees |
| `hr` | Manage employees & departments, approve any leave, view reports & audit logs |
| `manager` | Approve/reject leave for their direct reports, view their team's attendance |
| `employee` | Own profile, apply/cancel leave, check in/out, view own history & notifications |

