## ▶️ Running Locally

```bash
# 1. Clone
git clone https://github.com/<you>/worksphere.git && cd worksphere

# 2. Infrastructure
docker compose -f infra/docker-compose.yml up -d
./infra/scripts/create-topics.sh

# 3. Backend
cd server
cp .env.example .env
npm install
npm run migrate:up
npm run seed
npm run dev                 # API on :4000

# 4. Workers (separate terminals)
npm run worker:outbox
npm run worker:notifications
npm run worker:reporting

# 5. Frontend
cd ../client
npm install
npm run dev                 # http://localhost:5173
```

| Service | URL |
|---|---|
| Frontend | http://localhost:5173 |
| API | http://localhost:4000 |
| Kafka UI | http://localhost:8085 |
| Mailpit (emails) | http://localhost:8025 |

**Demo logins** (from seed): `admin@acme.test`, `manager@acme.test`, `employee@acme.test` — password `Password123!` (local only).

