## 📡 API Overview

Base path: `/api/v1`. All endpoints except auth/registration require `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`.

| Module | Method | Endpoint | Roles |
|---|---|---|---|
| Auth | POST | `/auth/register-company` | public |
| | POST | `/auth/login` | public |
| | POST | `/auth/refresh` | refresh cookie |
| | POST | `/auth/logout` | any |
| | GET | `/auth/me` | any |
| | GET / DELETE | `/auth/sessions`, `/auth/sessions/:id` | any (own) |
| | POST | `/auth/forgot-password`, `/auth/reset-password` | public |
| Company | GET / PATCH | `/company/settings` | admin |
| Departments | GET / POST / PATCH / DELETE | `/departments[/:id]` | read: all · write: admin, hr |
| Employees | GET | `/employees?search=&departmentId=&status=&limit=&cursor=` | admin, hr, manager (team) |
| | POST / PATCH | `/employees[/:id]` | admin, hr |
| | POST | `/employees/:id/deactivate` | admin, hr |
| | PATCH | `/employees/:id/role` | admin |
| Leave | GET / POST / PATCH | `/leave-types[/:id]` | read: all · write: admin |
| | GET | `/leave/balances/me` | any |
| | POST | `/leave/requests` | any |
| | GET | `/leave/requests/me` | any |
| | GET | `/leave/requests/pending` | manager, hr, admin |
| | POST | `/leave/requests/:id/approve` · `/reject` | manager (reports), hr, admin |
| | POST | `/leave/requests/:id/cancel` | owner (pending only) |
| Attendance | POST | `/attendance/check-in`, `/attendance/check-out` | any |
| | GET | `/attendance/me?month=` | any |
| | GET | `/attendance/daily?date=` · `/monthly?month=` | manager, hr, admin |
| Notifications | GET | `/notifications?unread=true` | any |
| | POST | `/notifications/:id/read`, `/notifications/read-all` | any |
| Reports | GET | `/reports/dashboard` | hr, admin (manager: team scope) |
| | GET | `/reports/leave/monthly?year=` | hr, admin |
| Audit | GET | `/audit-logs?entityType=&actorId=&from=&to=` | admin, hr |
| Health | GET | `/health/live`, `/health/ready` | public |

### Error format
```json
{ "error": { "code": "LEAVE_OVERLAP", "message": "You already have leave during these dates.", "requestId": "…" } }
```

| Status | When |
|---|---|
| 400 | Validation failed (Zod details included) |
| 401 | Missing/expired/invalid token |
| 403 | Authenticated but role not allowed |
| 404 | Not found **or belongs to another tenant** |
| 409 | Conflict: overlap, already decided, duplicate check-in, insufficient balance |
| 429 | Rate limited |
| 500 | Unexpected — logged with requestId, generic message to client |

Full documentation: [`docs/api.md`](docs/api.md)

