| Type | Tooling | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| Unit | Jest | working-day calculation, late detection across timezones/DST, token helpers |
| Integration | Jest + Supertest + real Postgres/Redis (Docker) | every endpoint's happy path + auth/role failures |
| **Tenant isolation** | Supertest | company B can't read/update/reference company A data on any endpoint |
| **Concurrency** | Jest + `Promise.all` | 10 parallel approvals → 1 success; parallel overlapping applies → 1 success; balance never negative |
| Idempotency | Jest | same Kafka event processed twice → one notification |

```bash
cd server
npm test                  # all
npm run test:unit
npm run test:integration  # requires docker compose up
npm run test:coverage
```

